In this example LJMS is used for conferencing application. 
Invisible applets (agents) sit in invisible frames. 
Applets connect with the server during initialization faze, so the server must be running.

Communication protocol with browser is very simple here:

add text <Enter>       - adds a text to the panel
clean <Enter>          - cleans browser
clear text <Enter>     - cleans browser's panel (content frame) and puts text text on it's place
file filename <Enter>  - opens a file on the server side and pushes it to the frame substituting previous content


